      <aside class="card">
        <div style="font-weight:600;color:#fff">Quick picks</div>
        <div style="margin-top:8px;color:#cbd5e1">A short inhalation practice, a roll-on with clear dilution, or a deeper 45-minute consult. Select a mood to see the recommended language for the booking button.</div>

        <div style="margin-top:12px">
